#indent 4

//: # check/module/memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver
//: `Eq` / `Hash` operation の method body effect fact table から、`SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck` を[作/つく]る checker-layer module です。
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - public impl surface から得た method body effect summary を、operation purity gate が読める typed check へ変換します。
//: - `Eq` / `Hash` は method body purity を必要とし、`Copy` / `Drop` は method body を必要としないことを、この境界で enum match として固定します。
//: - complete surface の lookup miss、incomplete surface、duplicate method body fact を bool や文字列に潰さず、後続 solver が fail-closed に扱える status / error として残します。
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `Complete` surface で `Eq` / `Hash` の候補が 1 件だけ見つかった場合だけ `Present` check を返します。
//: - `Complete` surface で `Eq` / `Hash` の候補が 0 件の場合は `Missing` check を返します。missing を pure success に畳みません。
//: - `Missing` surface は `Missing` check、`Unknown` surface は `Unknown` check に畳み、complete でない lookup miss を成功扱いしません。
//: - 同じ `SelfhostTypeId` と operation の method body fact が 2 件以上ある場合は `RecordDuplicate` として fail-closed に拒否します。record order による first-wins は使いません。
//: - `Copy` / `Drop` に対する resolver 呼び出しは table を探索せず `NotRequired` check を返します。method body fact は `Eq` / `Hash` 用であり、`selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_new_result` は `Copy` / `Drop` fact を拒否します。
//: - accepted fact は session-local `SelfhostTypeId`、operation enum、typed effect kind、typed escape state だけから作ります。source text、span、lexeme、display name、diagnostic text、module path、HIR、Resource IR、backend artifact、proof store record を authority にしません。
//: - actual expression checker、trait coherence、generic impl binder、Resource IR no-escape proof、private cache effect masking、full public surface orchestration は後続 stage の責務です。
//:
//: [現状/げんじょう]:
//: - Phase 1 では、actual checker が作った method body effect fact table を受け取る境界だけを提供します。
//: - facade にはまだ re-export しません。operation impl orchestration が method body resolver、Drop resolver、purity gate、impl table をまとめる段階で公開 API を再評価します。
//:
//: [計算量/けいさんりょう]:
//: - table push は `Vec` push の償却 O(1) 時間です。
//: - lookup は method body fact 数 n に対して O(n) 時間、O(1) 追加空間です。これは現状の実装詳細であり、typed error contract と first-wins 禁止を保ったまま sorted index や type / operation bucket へ後から置き換えられます。
//:
//: neplg2:test[stdio, normalize_newlines]
//: stdout: mlstr:
//: ##: Checked [ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok]
//: ##: [0] ok
//: ##: [1] ok
//: ##: [2] ok
//: ##: [3] ok
//: ##: [4] ok
//: ##: [5] ok
//: ##: [6] ok
//: ##: [7] ok
//: exit_code: 0
//: ```neplg2
//:| #entry main
//:| #target std
//:| #import "core/result" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/check/module/memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/check/module/memo_trait_operation_purity_gate" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/ty/effect" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/ty/ty/memo_trait_operation_evidence" as *
//:| #import "std/test" as *
//: fn main %impure fn void i32 \void:
//:     match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_stage0:
//:         Result::Ok summary:
//:             let checks0 checks_new
//:             let checks1 checks_push checks0 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_check_kind_eq summary.complete_missing SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind::Missing
//:             let checks2 checks_push checks1 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_check_kind_eq summary.complete_present_pure SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind::Present
//:             let checks3 checks_push checks2 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_check_effect_eq summary.complete_present_alloc_escape SelfhostEffectKind::InternalAlloc SelfhostEffectEscapeState::MayEscape
//:             let checks4 checks_push checks3 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_check_kind_eq summary.surface_missing SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind::Missing
//:             let checks5 checks_push checks4 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_check_kind_eq summary.surface_unknown SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind::Unknown
//:             let checks6 checks_push checks5 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_check_kind_eq summary.not_required_copy SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind::NotRequired
//:             let checks7 checks_push checks6 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_error_result_eq summary.duplicate_rejected SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordDuplicate
//:             let checks8 checks_push checks7 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_fact_error_result_eq summary.unexpected_operation_rejected SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::UnexpectedMethodOperation
//:             let shown checks_print_report checks8
//:             checks_exit_code shown
//:         Result::Err _setup:
//:             let checks0 checks_new
//:             let checks1 checks_push checks0 Result::Err "method body resolver stage0 setup failed"
//:             let shown checks_print_report checks1
//:             checks_exit_code shown
//: ```

#import "alloc/collections/vec" as v
#import "core/field" as field
#import "core/math" as *
#import "core/option" as *
#import "core/result" as *
#import "core/traits/copy" as *
#import "neplg2/core/ty/effect" as *
#import "neplg2/core/ty/ty/id" as *
#import "neplg2/core/ty/ty/memo_trait_operation_evidence" as *
#import "./memo_trait_operation_purity_gate" as *

//: SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodySurfaceState: method body fact table の[完全性/かんぜんせい]
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - complete でない table の lookup miss を method body missing proof にしないため、surface 状態を typed enum として持ちます。
pub enum SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodySurfaceState:
    Complete
    Missing
    Unknown

//: SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact: 1 つの operation method body effect fact
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - この fact は `Eq` / `Hash` の method body が存在し、effect summary が得られていることを表します。
//: - `operation` は `Eq` または `Hash` でなければなりません。`Copy` / `Drop` は method body check を必要としないため、fact constructor result で拒否します。
//: - `effect` と `escape` は actual method body checker / Resource proof が後続 stage で作る typed summary です。
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact:
    type_id %SelfhostTypeId
    operation %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind
    effect %SelfhostEffectKind
    escape %SelfhostEffectEscapeState

//: SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable: method body fact の session-local owner table
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `records` は owner buffer です。不要になったら `selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_table_free` で閉じます。
//: - table 自体は永続 artifact ではありません。complete 性は `SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodySurfaceState` で別に渡します。
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable:
    records %Vec SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact

//: SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind: method body resolver の構造的な拒否理由
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - table allocation / push / read / duplicate / operation mismatch を typed enum として分けます。
pub enum SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind:
    TableAllocFailed %StdErrorKind
    RecordPushFailed %StdErrorKind
    RecordReadFailed %i32
    RecordDuplicate
    UnexpectedMethodOperation

//: SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverStage0Summary: method body resolver smoke の代表結果
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverStage0Summary:
    complete_missing %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind
    complete_present_pure %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind
    complete_present_alloc_escape %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind
    surface_missing %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind
    surface_unknown %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind
    not_required_copy %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind
    duplicate_rejected %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind
    unexpected_operation_rejected %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodySurfaceState:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodySurfaceState SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodySurfaceState \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodySurfaceState:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodySurfaceState SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodySurfaceState \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverStage0Summary:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverStage0Summary SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverStage0Summary \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverStage0Summary:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverStage0Summary SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverStage0Summary \self:
        self

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_operation_required: operation が method body effect fact を[必要/ひつよう]とするか[返/かえ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_operation_required %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind bool \operation:
    match operation:
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind::Copy:
            false
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind::Drop:
            false
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind::Eq:
            true
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind::Hash:
            true

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_new_unchecked: validated fact payload を[作/つく]る
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_new_unchecked %fn SelfhostTypeId fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind fn SelfhostEffectKind fn SelfhostEffectEscapeState SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact \type_id\operation\effect\escape:
    SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact type_id operation effect escape

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_new_result: method body fact を[検査/けんさ]して[作/つく]る
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `Eq` / `Hash` だけを受理します。`Copy` / `Drop` に method body fact を作ることは、operation requirement matrix の退行なので拒否します。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_new_result %fn SelfhostTypeId fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind fn SelfhostEffectKind fn SelfhostEffectEscapeState Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind \type_id\operation\effect\escape:
    if:
        selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_operation_required operation
        then:
            Result::Ok selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_new_unchecked type_id operation effect escape
        else:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::UnexpectedMethodOperation

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_table_new: [空/から]の method body fact table を[作/つく]る
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - 返した table は `records` buffer を[所有/しょゆう]します。caller は resolver で[使/つか]い[終/お]えたあと `selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_table_free` で[閉/と]じます。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_table_new %impure fn void Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable StdErrorKind \void:
    let records_result %Result Vec SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact StdErrorKind v::new
    match records_result:
        Result::Ok records:
            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable records
        Result::Err e:
            Result::Err e

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_table_free: method body fact table の owner buffer を[閉/と]じる
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_table_free %impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable unit \table:
    v::free field::get table "records"

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_table_len: method body fact 数を[返/かえ]す
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_table_len %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable i32 \table:
    let records %&Vec SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact field::get_ref table "records"
    v::len records

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_table_push: method body fact を table に[追加/ついか]する
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - push 失敗時は `Vec` が返した owner を閉じ、`RecordPushFailed(error)` として `StdErrorKind` を保持します。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_table_push %impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind \table\fact:
    let records %Vec SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact field::get table "records"
    match v::push records fact:
        Result::Ok next_records:
            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable next_records
        Result::Err e:
            let error %StdErrorKind field::get e "error"
            v::free v::vec_push_error_vec e
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordPushFailed error

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_matches: fact が TypeId / operation に[一致/いっち]するか[返/かえ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_matches %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact fn SelfhostTypeId fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind bool \fact\type_id\operation:
    and:
        selfhost_type_id_eq fact.type_id type_id
        selfhost_memo_trait_operation_evidence_kind_eq fact.operation operation

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_check: present fact を method body check へ[写/うつ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_check %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck \fact:
    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_check_new SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind::Present fact.effect fact.escape

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_missing_check: method body 欠落 check を[作/つく]る
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_missing_check %fn void SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck \void:
    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_check_new SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind::Missing SelfhostEffectKind::Pure SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NotApplicable

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_unknown_check: method body 未判定 check を[作/つく]る
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_unknown_check %fn void SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck \void:
    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_check_new SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind::Unknown SelfhostEffectKind::Pure SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NotApplicable

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_not_required_check: method body 不要 check を[作/つく]る
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_not_required_check %fn void SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck \void:
    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_check_new SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind::NotRequired SelfhostEffectKind::Pure SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NotApplicable

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_find_finish: complete surface lookup を typed check へ[畳/たた]む
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_find_finish %fn Option SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind \found:
    match found:
        Option::Some check:
            Result::Ok check
        Option::None:
            Result::Ok selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_missing_check

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_find_loop: complete table から method body fact を[探/さが]す
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - 同じ `SelfhostTypeId` と operation の fact が 2 件以上ある場合は `RecordDuplicate` として拒否します。
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_find_loop %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable fn SelfhostTypeId fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind fn i32 fn Option SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind \table\type_id\operation\idx\found:
    if:
        ge idx selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_table_len table
        then:
            selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_find_finish found
        else:
            let records %&Vec SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact field::get_ref table "records"
            match v::get records idx:
                Option::Some fact:
                    if:
                        selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_matches fact type_id operation
                        then:
                            match found:
                                Option::Some _existing:
                                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordDuplicate
                                Option::None:
                                    let check %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_check fact
                                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_find_loop table type_id operation add idx 1 some check
                        else:
                            selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_find_loop table type_id operation add idx 1 found
                Option::None:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordReadFailed idx

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolve_result: surface state と fact table から method body check を[作/つく]る
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `Copy` / `Drop` は method body を必要としないため、surface state や table 中身に関係なく `NotRequired` を返します。
//: - `Eq` / `Hash` は `Complete` のときだけ table を探索します。
//: - `Missing` / `Unknown` は構造的な resolver error ではなく、後続 solver が fail-closed に扱う status です。これらを `Present` に畳むことはありません。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolve_result %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodySurfaceState fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable fn SelfhostTypeId fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind \surface\table\type_id\operation:
    if:
        selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_operation_required operation
        then:
            match surface:
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodySurfaceState::Complete:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_find_loop table type_id operation 0 none
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodySurfaceState::Missing:
                    Result::Ok selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_missing_check
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodySurfaceState::Unknown:
                    Result::Ok selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_unknown_check
        else:
            Result::Ok selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_not_required_check

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_std_error_kind_code: StdErrorKind を比較用 code へ[写/うつ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_std_error_kind_code %fn StdErrorKind i32 \kind:
    match kind:
        StdErrorKind::Failure:
            0
        StdErrorKind::OutOfMemory:
            1
        StdErrorKind::EmptyCollection:
            2
        StdErrorKind::IndexOutOfBounds:
            3
        StdErrorKind::KeyNotFound:
            4
        StdErrorKind::CapacityExceeded:
            5
        StdErrorKind::InvalidOperation:
            6
        StdErrorKind::InvalidUtf8:
            7
        StdErrorKind::ParseError:
            8
        StdErrorKind::IoError:
            9
        StdErrorKind::Other:
            10

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_std_error_kind_eq: StdErrorKind が同じ variant か[返/かえ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_std_error_kind_eq %fn StdErrorKind fn StdErrorKind bool \a\b:
    eq selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_std_error_kind_code a selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_std_error_kind_code b

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_error_kind_eq: resolver error が同じ分類か[返/かえ]す
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - payload を持つ error は payload まで比較します。
//: - wildcard arm は使いません。error variant が増えた場合はこの equality 境界を明示的に更新します。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_error_kind_eq %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind bool \a\b:
    match a:
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::TableAllocFailed a_alloc:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::TableAllocFailed b_alloc:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_std_error_kind_eq a_alloc b_alloc
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordPushFailed _b_push:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordReadFailed _b_read:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordDuplicate:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::UnexpectedMethodOperation:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordPushFailed a_push:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::TableAllocFailed _b_alloc:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordPushFailed b_push:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_std_error_kind_eq a_push b_push
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordReadFailed _b_read:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordDuplicate:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::UnexpectedMethodOperation:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordReadFailed a_idx:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::TableAllocFailed _b_alloc:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordPushFailed _b_push:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordReadFailed b_idx:
                    eq a_idx b_idx
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordDuplicate:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::UnexpectedMethodOperation:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordDuplicate:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::TableAllocFailed _b_alloc:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordPushFailed _b_push:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordReadFailed _b_read:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordDuplicate:
                    true
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::UnexpectedMethodOperation:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::UnexpectedMethodOperation:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::TableAllocFailed _b_alloc:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordPushFailed _b_push:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordReadFailed _b_read:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordDuplicate:
                    false
